    "body": "Note: Since prefetch uses https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#create-link-options-from-element it is also impacted by referrerpolicy, fetchpriority, and integrity.\r\n\r\nBut, it seems like no \"appropriate times to fetch and process\" consult those. So, this is probably correct.\r\n\r\nWe can leave potentially sorting this out in a more holistic manner, with tests, for https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8138.",
